  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the bulgur and soak it in water for 30 minutes. Drain and set aside.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the kisir, tomato, red onion, and parsley.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Add the bulgur to the bowl with the kisir mixture and pour the lemon juice mixture over it.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Mix well and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature."
